      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"SqlSort.SqlOrder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>SqlSort.SqlOrder</code></a> instance. Takes a single property. Direction is <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Direction.html#ASC\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Direction.ASC</code></a> and\nNullHandling <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.NullHandling.html#NATIVE\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.NullHandling.NATIVE</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新<a href=\"SqlSort.SqlOrder.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.relational.domain 中的类\"><code>SqlSort.SqlOrder</code></a>实例。该实例仅接受一个属性，排序方向为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Direction.html#ASC\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的类或接口\"><code>Sort.Direction.ASC</code></a>，空值处理方式为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.NullHandling.html#NATIVE\" title=\"org.springframework.data.domain 中的类或接口\"><code>Sort.NullHandling.NATIVE</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
