    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"SqlSort.SqlOrder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>SqlSort.SqlOrder</code></a> instance. Takes a single property. Direction defaults to\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html#DEFAULT_DIRECTION\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.DEFAULT_DIRECTION</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新<a href=\"SqlSort.SqlOrder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.domain\"><code>SqlSort.SqlOrder</code></a>实例。接受单个属性。方向默认为\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html#DEFAULT_DIRECTION\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.DEFAULT_DIRECTION</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Custom <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Order.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Order</code></a> that keeps a flag to indicate unsafe property handling, i.e. the String provided is not\nnecessarily a property but can be an arbitrary expression piped into the query execution. We also keep an\nadditional <code>ignoreCase</code> flag around as the constructor of the superclass is private currently.",
      "translation": "自定义一个带有标记以指示不安全属性处理的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.Order.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort.Order</code></a>类，即所提供的字符串不一定是属性，而可能是任意表达式并传入查询执行中。此外，由于当前父类的构造函数为私有，我们还保留了一个额外的<code>ignoreCase</code>标记。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
